diff --git a/uwp/host/Assets/horizon-release-notes-2026-11-03-f42ef42.txt b/uwp/host/Assets/horizon-release-notes-2026-11-03-f42ef42.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..4edf697f0b92b8d332b26d4464195e27aca89a63
--- /dev/null
+++ b/uwp/host/Assets/horizon-release-notes-2026-11-03-f42ef42.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,882 @@
+<h1>Want to play? Download the <a href="https://playhorizon.dev">Horizon launcher</a>.</h1><h1>Do NOT run the files below. They will not work on their own.</h1><p>The launcher installs this version and keeps it up to date. You need your own copy of Minecraft: Java Edition. The files below are what the launcher installs, and the dedicated server for people who host one.</p>
+
+Nightly 2026-11-03 · f42ef42: main (f42ef42), built from `nightly/build-2026-11-03-2` (f42ef42ef6ceccb3c6a20bea2481d87949a51c81).
+
+Source: commit f42ef42ef6ceccb3c6a20bea2481d87949a51c81, kept for good as the tag `nightly-source/2026-11-03-f42ef42`; horizon-source.tar.gz is its tree. Native mods built for this Nightly pin that commit.
+
+The launcher installs it by itself; your worlds stay as they are. A Nightly can include pull requests the Team picked before they are merged (below). Report bugs with the version the game shows ("Nightly <date> · <commit>").
+
+### New
+- Add asynchronous mode to entity occlusion culling (#6033, fixes #5939)
+- The game can keep under a RAM limit (#5800)
+- Native mods: living_knockback, change or cancel the knockback an entity takes (API next) (#5637, fixes #5496)
+- fix(mods): count the host's own player and golems as container viewers (#6078, fixes #6077)
+- Localization: Horizon's own strings in Polish, Ukrainian, German and French (#5645)
+- feat(mods): native server mods can edit blocks in bulk (#5735, fixes #5734)
+- feat(mods): native server mods can read surface heights and columns (#5737, fixes #5736)
+- feat(mods): mod menu types on the vanilla menu engine, and a hook for their slot rules (#5866)
+- feat(mods): native mods act on an item's use tick and release (#5905)
+- Native mods: a loot table's function and condition of a mod's own kind (#6142, fixes #5451)
+- Native mods: a server's levels loading and unloading (LevelEvent) (#6163, fixes #6154)
+- feat(mods): a content block's random_ticks property (#6167, fixes #6138)
+- Native mods: the client's level made and dropped (LevelEvent on the client) (#6201)
+- Native mods: a projectile's impact, ProjectileImpactEvent (#6279, fixes #6203)
+- Native mods: an entity mounting or dismounting, EntityMountEvent (#6281, fixes #6273)
+- Native mods: the attack, use and pick keys, InputEvent.InteractionKeyMappingTriggered (#6289, fixes #6213)
+- Native mods: drawing between the HUD's own layers, RegisterGuiLayersEvent (#6290, fixes #6243)
+- Native mods: their own icons on maps, the client half of MapDecorationType (#6292, fixes #6269)
